From: Albus <albus@example.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 21:05:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] README: make the calibration workflow the real procedure

The old version listed the four commands but none of the checks between them.
Every gate added here corresponds to a failure that is invisible until after
you have spent twenty minutes sampling: no camera frames, marker never
detected, camera subtree already broken, or a result whose translation is
physically impossible.

Also folds in CAMERA_TF_ROOT, finding the robot IP from the host, and the
final tape-measure check against base_link.
